# S5-07 post-IRET page-walk diagnostic pair — 2026-11-15

## Scope and provenance

Two independent counted single runs used the schema-v5 execution-observations sidecar and selected zero-based delivered-#PF ordinal 30. They are diagnostic runs, not the automatic S5-07 N=2 series, and no strict comparator ran. Both ran `linux-direct --run --budget 3000000000 --set-cpl0 --cpuid-profile stage4a --user-mode --execution-observations-out ... --execution-observations-post-iret-index 30` with 128 MiB RAM and distinct nonces. Both reached the instruction-budget stop at `retired=2,999,999,998`; both loaded Linux and emitted the run nonce.

Source revision: `ca7f6b2` (schema-v5 post-IRET implementation).

Release runner SHA-256: `c3467f73ed5f5e2d8ac50593ceccd545d3f220eb796c86e47bca996e47ad3917`.

